-### Parameters
-*   **Brick Size:** 32^3 voxels (typical, used in evaluations) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Leaf-Node Sizes:** 32^3, 16^3, 8^3, or 8x8x4 (decoupled from brick size) [S1, unofficial].
